<view class="page"><member-brand/><view class="search"><text>⌕</text><input placeholder="可搜索公开会员名册、活动、资料和需求机会" value="{{query}}" bindinput="onSearch"/></view><view class="notice notice-safe">仅有会员授权公开信息可搜索，私密个人及需求匹配信息不可被搜索，请放心。</view><view class="timeline"><view class="feed-row" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><view class="feed-mark">{{item.label}}</view><view class="feed-main"><view class="row-title clamp-title" aria-label="{{item.title}}">{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.summary}}</view><view class="feed-actions"><text wx:if="{{item.kind==='activity'}}" class="text-button" data-id="{{item.targetId}}" bindtap="register">报名登记</text><text wx:if="{{item.kind==='activity'}}" class="muted">报名不承诺会议席位</text></view></view><text wx:if="{{item.kind==='resource'||item.kind==='activity'}}" class="favorite {{item.favorited?'saved':''}}" data-type="{{item.kind}}" data-id="{{item.targetId}}" data-saved="{{item.favorited}}" bindtap="toggleFavorite">☆</text></view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!items.length}}">暂无安全可见更新</view></view>
